Assembly template "plan-official"
(plugins/hancom-desktop/skills/hwpx/assets/document-templates/assembly/plan-official)

The layout of these parts is taken from 경기도교육청, 「2027. 3. 1.자 공립
유·초등교원 시·도간 교류 추진 계획」, a public work of a local education office
used under 저작권법 제24조의2 with attribution. The parts carry neutral
placeholders only; no wording of the original document and no agency logo is
included.

Assembly templates "report-brief" and "event-plan"
(plugins/hancom-desktop/skills/hwpx/assets/document-templates/assembly/report-brief, event-plan)

The layout of these parts is taken from attachments of two press releases on
대한민국 정책브리핑 (korea.kr), whose text is released under 공공누리 제1유형
(출처표시, KOGL Type 1): 고용노동부, 「2026년도 전 생애 노동교육 실태조사 주요
결과」 and 산업통상부, 「동아제약 현장방문 개요」. The parts carry neutral
placeholders only; no pictures and no wording of the originals are included. The
reproduction outlines used to test the templates repeat the original text.
